[{"name":"Release v0.2.0","uuid":"391468889","tag_name":"v0.2.0","target_commitish":"main","body":"## v0.2.0\r\n\r\n\u003c!-- BEGIN GENERATED RELEASE NOTES --\u003e\r\n\u003c!-- Generated by scripts/changelog.sh. Edit PR release-note blocks\r\n     and rerun the workflow to change this block. Add hand-written overview,\r\n     upgrade notes, and known issues outside this block. --\u003e\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n\r\n#### Feature\r\n\r\n- Added SSH Git access for model repositories with public-key authentication, automatic model registration during clone and push, and configurable SSH port exposure for Docker Compose and Helm deployments. ([#697](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/697), [@setsunakute](https://github.com/setsunakute))\r\n\r\n- The registry management UI now supports creating and managing MatrixHub-type registries. ([#710](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/710), [@lsq645599166](https://github.com/lsq645599166))\r\n\r\n- Prepare config.yaml in the same folder with docker-compose.yml to make docker compose setup steps easier ([#814](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/814), [@yitingdc](https://github.com/yitingdc))\r\n\r\n- Refactor(chart): use StatefulSet for MySQL with volumeClaimTemplates ([#890](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/890), [@wzshiming](https://github.com/wzshiming))\r\n\r\n- Guide users to create a registry when the target registry selector is empty during project creation. ([#957](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/957), [@linghaoSu](https://github.com/linghaoSu))\r\n\r\n- Added SQLite support for single-node deployments. Docker Compose now uses SQLite by default, while MySQL remains available through an explicit Compose configuration. Helm/Kubernetes deployments do not support SQLite. ([#962](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/962), [@setsunakute](https://github.com/setsunakute))\r\n\r\n- Improve guidance for the Registry Base URL field when creating a registry: provider-specific hints and defaults, a confirmation before overwriting a customized URL on provider switch, and a warning for addresses that look like a specific repository. ([#995](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/995), [@linghaoSu](https://github.com/linghaoSu))\r\n\r\n#### Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- Copy buttons now work when MatrixHub is served over HTTP. ([#678](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/678), [@lsq645599166](https://github.com/lsq645599166))\r\n\r\n- Robot accounts now enforce disabled and expired states and all-project permissions, while model commits made with robot credentials show the correct uploader. ([#688](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/688), [@setsunakute](https://github.com/setsunakute))\r\n\r\n- Long registry names now wrap correctly in the delete confirmation dialog. ([#718](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/718), [@lsq645599166](https://github.com/lsq645599166))\r\n\r\n- Project settings now display a success notification after changes are saved. ([#719](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/719), [@lsq645599166](https://github.com/lsq645599166))\r\n\r\n- Creating a model now rejects names longer than 251 characters. ([#729](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/729), [@scydas](https://github.com/scydas))\r\n\r\n- Model parameter counts are now displayed correctly for single-file safetensors models and sharded models without total-size metadata. ([#739](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/739), [@scydas](https://github.com/scydas))\r\n\r\n- Fixed model size display to use repository tree content size instead of Git repository disk usage. ([#759](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/759), [@scydas](https://github.com/scydas))\r\n\r\n- Fix Markdown previews to consistently use the light color scheme. ([#761](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/761), [@vivian-xu](https://github.com/vivian-xu))\r\n\r\n- Creating a model now rejects invalid names and normalizes model identifiers to avoid detail-page 404s caused by leading or trailing whitespace. ([#781](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/781), [@scydas](https://github.com/scydas))\r\n\r\n- Updated Go and quic-go to address known security vulnerabilities. ([#797](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/797), [@scydas](https://github.com/scydas))\r\n\r\n- Fixed duplicate-resource error handling and addressed a database dependency vulnerability. ([#803](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/803), [@scydas](https://github.com/scydas))\r\n\r\n- Hardened repository listing and authentication against malformed namespace and token inputs. ([#822](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/822), [@setsunakute](https://github.com/setsunakute))\r\n\r\n- Hardened model repository listing to prevent author filters from accessing content outside the configured storage directory. ([#830](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/830), [@setsunakute](https://github.com/setsunakute))\r\n\r\n- Fix the homepage Quick Start link so it opens the Getting Started guide. ([#880](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/880), [@yitingdc](https://github.com/yitingdc))\r\n\r\n- Project member dialogs now explain role permissions and default new members to the Viewer role. ([#887](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/887), [@linghaoSu](https://github.com/linghaoSu))\r\n\r\n- Project viewers no longer see the Create Model action, which is now limited to project administrators and editors. ([#900](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/900), [@linghaoSu](https://github.com/linghaoSu))\r\n\r\n- Create and edit sync rule dialogs now adapt their layout to the selected language so field labels remain readable. ([#904](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/904), [@linghaoSu](https://github.com/linghaoSu))\r\n\r\n- Enlarged the create access token button on the profile page to match other create buttons. ([#907](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/907), [@linghaoSu](https://github.com/linghaoSu))\r\n\r\n- Hugging Face registry discovery now uses the configured mirror or proxy URL, and the sync job API now exposes the PENDING status correctly. ([#915](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/915), [@Phil-OSophy-42](https://github.com/Phil-OSophy-42))\r\n\r\n- Manually triggered replication runs are now recorded and displayed with the Manual trigger type, even when the policy is scheduled. ([#918](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/918), [@Phil-OSophy-42](https://github.com/Phil-OSophy-42))\r\n\r\n- Fixed model creation after a failed upload leaves an existing repository without a database record. ([#930](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/930), [@scydas](https://github.com/scydas))\r\n\r\n- Manually specified robot account tokens must now be 8–20 characters and include at least one uppercase letter, one lowercase letter, and one number. ([#937](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/937), [@setsunakute](https://github.com/setsunakute))\r\n\r\n- SSH key registration now returns clear errors when a key is already registered or has expired. ([#939](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/939), [@setsunakute](https://github.com/setsunakute))\r\n\r\n- Made project selection dropdowns scrollable and searchable, with a clear selected-project indicator. ([#945](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/945), [@linghaoSu](https://github.com/linghaoSu))\r\n\r\n- Improved empty model repository guidance and allowed projects to be created directly from the model creation form. ([#947](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/947), [@linghaoSu](https://github.com/linghaoSu))\r\n\r\n- Large per-file commit diffs now show an inline raw diff link while the existing 50-file limit remains unchanged. ([#948](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/948), [@linghaoSu](https://github.com/linghaoSu))\r\n\r\n- Fixed remote sync reporting success while leaving the model/dataset description, size and labels empty in the database. Dataset sync no longer creates model records instead of dataset records. ([#950](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/950), [@Phil-OSophy-42](https://github.com/Phil-OSophy-42))\r\n\r\n- Remove misleading resource name placeholder in replication form- #954 ([#954](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/954), [@linghaoSu](https://github.com/linghaoSu))\r\n\r\n- Adds an explanation of the public / private project types, so users understand what each visibility level means before picking one. ([#956](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/956), [@linghaoSu](https://github.com/linghaoSu))\r\n\r\n- make table columns fit and keep row actions reachable. ([#958](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/958), [@linghaoSu](https://github.com/linghaoSu))\r\n\r\n- Delete/Remove actions across admin pages, project members, projects list, access tokens, and SSH keys now consistently display in red. ([#986](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/986), [@linghaoSu](https://github.com/linghaoSu))\r\n\r\n- Fixed the project name link font size in the Projects table to match the rest of the table text. ([#987](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/987), [@linghaoSu](https://github.com/linghaoSu))\r\n\r\n- Fixed an issue where updating a robot account could unintentionally disable it. The robot’s enabled status is now preserved unless explicitly changed. ([#993](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/pull/993), [@setsunakute](https://github.com/setsunakute))\r\n\r\n[Full Changelog](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/compare/v0.1.0...v0.2.0)\r\n\r\n\u003c!-- END GENERATED RELEASE NOTES --\u003e\r\n\r\n## Supply-chain verification\r\n\r\nThe release container image is keylessly signed with Cosign and has an attached SPDX SBOM.\r\n\r\nVerify the image signature and download the SBOM:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\ncosign verify \\\r\n  --certificate-identity-regexp 'https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/.*' \\\r\n  --certificate-oidc-issuer 'https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com' \\\r\n  ghcr.io/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub:v0.2.0\r\n\r\ncosign download sbom ghcr.io/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub:v0.2.0\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe SBOM includes the `github.com/matrixhub-ai/hfd` dependency. See the [Security Policy](https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/blob/main/SECURITY.md) for additional supply-chain and vulnerability-handling details.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"immutable":false,"published_at":"2026-09-18T13:41:49.000Z","created_at":"2026-09-22T16:16:50.439Z","author":"github-actions[bot]","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/releases/assets/572615504","id":572615504,"node_id":"RA_kwDOQ16Jfc4iIWtQ","name":"matrixhub-0.2.0.tgz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"raw","state":"uploaded","size":7762,"digest":"sha256:ce056dd1add657470fec69c7f766ca2cb146092fde76ca73fa988529902f6601","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-18T12:46:22.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T12:46:22.000Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/releases/download/v0.2.0/matrixhub-0.2.0.tgz"}],"last_synced_at":"2026-09-22T16:16:50.236Z","html_url":"https://github.com/matrixhub-ai/matrixhub/releases/tag/v0.2.0","release_url":"https://repos.ecosyste.ms/api/v1/hosts/GitHub/repositories/matrixhub-ai%2Fmatrixhub/releases/v0.2.0","tag_url":"https://repos.ecosyste.ms/api/v1/hosts/GitHub/repositories/matrixhub-ai%2Fmatrixhub/tags/v0.2.0"}]